</svg></div></section><section class="custom-container grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-20 mt-32 mb-28"><div><h2 class="heading-underline text-white font-display text-4xl max-w-[21ch] mb-6">The Challenge</h2><div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[80ch] whitespace-pre-line">AdventHealth’s Research Institute needed a video to showcase the world-changing diabetes research they were conducting while appealing to partners and volunteers. In turn, we needed to capture the full story of their extensive and complex research in a way that was accessible. </div></div><div><h2 class="heading-underline text-white font-display text-4xl max-w-[21ch] mb-6">Our Process</h2><div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[80ch] whitespace-pre-line">We wanted the video to feel approachable from all angles, so we minimized medical jargon and kept our approach honest and human by showing all the meaningful faces behind diabetes—patients, caregivers, doctors, researchers, and scientists. We filmed over several days to capture exciting footage throughout the organization. Then we set to editing and hacking away until we held the final result.</div></div><div><h2 class="heading-underline text-white font-display text-4xl max-w-[21ch] mb-6">The Results</h2><div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[80ch] whitespace-pre-line">The video was a success. By alternating between the personal and the medical, we were able to create a powerful piece that spoke to the challenges of diabetes and diabetes research, all while shining a light on the faces working toward a cure.

To this day, AdventHealth is one of our longest-lasting partners, and we continue to work with them whenever they need video.</div></div></section><section class="text-white mb-28"><div class="text-left mt-48"><h2 class="lg:text-4xl font-display leading-[.95] mb-28 text-center heading-underline">More of Our Work</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 mb-28"><div class="col-span-1 flex flex-col" min-h-full><a
